39410>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
39410>>>                Case Break
39411>>>
39411>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
39411>>>
39411>>>        Case End
39411>>>
39411>>>        Send SetActionButtons
